# The build context is the repository root, and the image needs only these:
# the project metadata and lock, the package, and the model bundles that `dvc
# pull` put under models/ (the Dockerfile copies one of them and the comparables
# index). Everything else,
# data, .venv, .git and the credentials in .env included, never leaves the
# machine that builds.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!recommenditos/
!models/

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
